            <dl class="entrylist">
                <dt>
                    <a href="/blogs/ryanc/archive/2008/08/26/outlook-2007-does-the-little-things.aspx">Outlook 2007 does the little things</a>
                </dt>
                <dd>
                    <p>People give Microsoft Outlook a lot of crap, but if you&#39;re willing to think outside the box, you&#39;ll realize they did all the little things that make life easy.&nbsp; For instance, I rarely use the calendar popup for creating new appointments.&nbsp; No, if I have a meeting next Wednesday, I type &quot;<em>next wed&quot;</em> and hit tab.&nbsp; It&#39;s at 1pm, well, type 1 and hit tab.</p> <p>Done.</p> <p><a href="http://cromwellhaus.com/cfs-file.ashx/__key/CommunityServer.Blogs.Components.WeblogFiles/ryanc/image_5F00_2.png"><img height="413" alt="New Appt. Screenshot" src="http://cromwellhaus.com/cfs-file.ashx/__key/CommunityServer.Blogs.Components.WeblogFiles/ryanc/image_5F00_thumb.png" width="640" border="0" /></a></p><div style="clear:both;"></div>

                    <div class="entryviewfooter">
                        	
                        <span class="em">Posted </span>
